// Game: Postretro
// Format: Standard
// E18 projectile-trap volley fixture: trigger wiring with no data script.
// Compile: cargo run -p postretro-level-compiler -- content/dev/maps/trap-volley.map -o content/dev/maps/trap-volley.prl
// The centre plate fires every `volley` trap on Enter (re-arming after 1.5 s);
// the north plate starts them repeating and the south plate stops them. The
// east-wall traps author their facing as `angle`, `angles` and `mangle`. The
// `sentry` trap starts on spawn and sweeps across the room every two seconds;
// the `updown` plate fires one trap straight up and one straight down.
